Closing this because V2 now supports the same behavior through #41882.

V2 keybinds use command IDs directly, so the binding is now configured in `~/.config/opencode/cli.json` as:

```json
{
  "keybinds": {
    "permission.mode": "super+shift+a"
  }
}
```

This PR targets the V1 `dev` keybind architecture and is no longer needed now that the equivalent behavior is implemented and tested in V2. Thanks @thepigdestroyer for independently validating the original implementation.

